    "en": {
      "trackName": "Checkers: Watch & Phone",
      "description": "Checkers: Watch & Phone brings classic checkers to both iPhone and Apple Watch in a clean, focused experience built for quick games and deeper matches alike.\n\nPlay with different rulesets, challenge a friend on the same device, or face the AI at the difficulty level that feels right for you. Whether you want a casual round or a sharper test, the game is easy to pick up and satisfying to master.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPlay on iPhone and Apple Watch\nMultiple checkers rulesets\nSolo play against AI\nLocal two-player mode\nAdjustable AI strength\nClean, readable board design\nFast and simple game setup\nFrom quick moves on your wrist to full games on your phone, CheckersWatchPhone makes it easy to enjoy checkers anywhere.",
      "releaseNotes": "Adding new languages\nBugfixes",
